<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="th">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title><%= title %></title>
    <link
      href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css"
      rel="stylesheet"
    />
    <style>
      :root {
        --primary: #0d3b66;
        --primary-2: #1f5ea8;
        --primary-3: #6aa9ff;
        --secondary: #dfeeff;
        --navy: #061d38;
        --text: #1e2a3b;
        --muted: #6a7d96;
        --light: #f4f9ff;
        --card: #ffffff;
      }

      body {
        font-family: "Segoe UI", Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
        background: linear-gradient(180deg, #edf7ff 0%, #dfeeff 100%);
        color: var(--text);
      }

      .bg-primary-custom {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary) 0%, var(--navy) 100%);
      }

      .text-primary-custom {
        color: var(--primary);
      }

      .nav-link {
        color: #e8f3ff !important;
        font-weight: 500;
      }

      .nav-link:hover {
        color: #bfe0ff !important;
      }

      .hero {
        background: radial-gradient(circle at top left, rgba(106, 169, 255, 0.4), transparent 40%),
          linear-gradient(135deg, #edf7ff 0%, #dfeeff 100%);
      }

      .hero-card {
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.86);
        border: 1px solid rgba(13, 59, 102, 0.08);
        backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
      }

      .category-card,
      .product-card {
        border: 1px solid rgba(13, 59, 102, 0.08);
        border-radius: 18px;
        overflow: hidden;
        transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
      }

      .category-card:hover,
      .product-card:hover {
        transform: translateY(-4px);
        box-shadow: 0 16px 35px rgba(13, 59, 102, 0.12);
      }

      .product-card .img-box {
        height: 220px;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #edf6ff 0%, #dfeeff 100%);
      }

      .product-thumb {
        width: 180px;
        height: 180px;
        border-radius: 18px;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #a6d2ff 0%, #6aa9ff 100%);
        position: relative;
        box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 12px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
      }

      .product-thumb::before,
      .product-thumb::after {
        content: "";
        position: absolute;
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.55);
      }

      .product-thumb::before {
        width: 110px;
        height: 80px;
        left: 35px;
        top: 40px;
        border-radius: 12px;
      }

      .product-thumb::after {
        width: 100px;
        height: 12px;
        left: 40px;
        bottom: 32px;
        border-radius: 8px;
      }

      .product-thumb.monitor::before {
        width: 110px;
        height: 72px;
      }

      .product-thumb.keyboard::before {
        width: 120px;
        height: 45px;
        left: 30px;
        top: 60px;
      }

      .product-thumb.keyboard::after {
        width: 120px;
        height: 10px;
        left: 30px;
        bottom: 42px;
      }

      .product-thumb.mouse::before {
        width: 65px;
        height: 50px;
        left: 58px;
        top: 56px;
        border-radius: 50% 50% 42% 42%;
      }

      .product-thumb.mouse::after {
        width: 18px;
        height: 18px;
        left: 80px;
        bottom: 40px;
        border-radius: 50%;
      }

      .product-thumb.accessory::before {
        width: 75px;
        height: 75px;
        left: 52px;
        top: 52px;
        border-radius: 50%;
      }

      .product-thumb.accessory::after {
        width: 90px;
        height: 12px;
        left: 45px;
        bottom: 30px;
      }

      .aside-box {
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75);
        border: 1px solid rgba(13, 59, 102, 0.08);
        border-radius: 18px;
      }

      .list-group-item {
        border-radius: 12px !important;
        border: 1px solid rgba(13, 59, 102, 0.08);
        margin-bottom: 8px;
      }

      .btn-primary-custom {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary-2) 0%, var(--primary) 100%);
        border: none;
      }

      .btn-primary-custom:hover {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary) 0%, var(--navy) 100%);
      }

      footer {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--navy) 0%, var(--primary) 100%);
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <header class="bg-primary-custom text-white shadow-sm">
      <div class="container py-3">
        <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center">
          <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-3">
            <div class="bg-white rounded-circle d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center" style="width: 42px; height: 42px; color: var(--primary); font-weight: 800;">
              B
            </div>
            <div>
              <h1 class="h4 mb-0 fw-bold">BlueWave</h1>
              <small class="text-light">Computer & Accessories</small>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="d-none d-md-flex align-items-center gap-4">
            <span class="small text-light">โทร: 02-888-5555</span>
            <span class="small text-light">จัดส่งฟรีเมื่อสั่งเกิน 2,000 บาท</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <nav class="navbar navbar-expand-lg navbar-dark pb-3">
        <div class="container">
          <button class="navbar-toggler" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#mainNav">
            <span class="navbar-toggler-icon"></span>
          </button>
            <div class="collapse navbar-collapse" id="mainNav">
              <ul class="navbar-nav me-auto mb-2 mb-lg-0 gap-lg-3">
              <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link active" href="/">หน้าแรก</a></li>
              <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/product">สินค้า</a></li>
              <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/showProduct">สินค้าทั้งหมด</a></li>
              <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="#promo">โปรโมชั่น</a></li>
              <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="#support">บริการหลังการขาย</a></li>
              <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/about">เกี่ยวกับเรา</a></li>
            </ul>
            <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-3">
              <a href="#" class="btn btn-outline-light btn-sm">เข้าสู่ระบบ</a>
              <a href="#" class="btn btn-primary-custom btn-sm px-3">ตะกร้าสินค้า</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </nav>
    </header>


    <main>
<%- body %>
    </main>

    <footer id="support" class="text-white pt-5 pb-4">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="row g-4">
          <div class="col-md-4">
            <h4 class="fw-bold mb-3">BlueWave</h4>
            <p class="text-light small mb-0">ร้านขายอุปกรณ์คอมพิวเตอร์ครบวงจรสำหรับทุกความต้องการ ตั้งแต่งานประจำวัน จนถึงเกมมิ่งและการทำงานเชิงธุรกิจ</p>
          </div>
          <div class="col-md-4">
            <h6 class="fw-bold mb-3">เมนูหลัก</h6>
            <ul class="list-unstyled small text-light">
              <li class="mb-2">หน้าแรก</li>
              <li class="mb-2">สินค้าใหม่</li>
              <li class="mb-2">โปรโมชั่น</li>
              <li>บทความแนะนำ</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="col-md-4">
            <h6 class="fw-bold mb-3">ติดต่องานบริการ</h6>
            <ul class="list-unstyled small text-light">
              <li class="mb-2">โทร: 02-888-5555</li>
              <li class="mb-2">อีเมล: support@bluewave.com</li>
              <li>เวลาทำการ: จันทร์ - เสาร์ 9:00 - 18:00</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="border-top border-light border-opacity-25 mt-4 pt-3 text-center small text-light">
          © 2026 BlueWave Computer Store. All rights reserved.
        </div>
      </div>
    </footer>

    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
  </body>
</html>
